    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> GAME DESCRIPTION: </h2>The further you dive into this mysterious adventure, the more you learn about the shocking events, that happened in David's life, and the clinic on Brut Street.<br>The plot develops rapidly and merges you into a mystical and dangerous story written in all the best traditions of the Survival Horror genre.<br>Throughout the game, you'll visit many dark and atmospheric locations, solve various puzzles, fight various enemies and make different decisions along the way.<br> <br>Everything will depend on you! This dangerous adventure will have three outcomes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547860/extras/cddc4505b3e56d60825d90ea7c6ebf07.poster.avif?t=1746096163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547860/extras/cddc4505b3e56d60825d90ea7c6ebf07.webm?t=1746096163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547860/extras/cddc4505b3e56d60825d90ea7c6ebf07.mp4?t=1746096163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> FEATURES: </h2><br><strong> Large game map </strong><br>\u2022 12 city locations.<br>\u2022 3 hospital floors<br>\u2022 10 floors, &quot;Krot-529&quot; scientific underground station.<br>\u2022 Each floor has a unique interior.<br>\u2022 Replayability.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547860/extras/a2e804ddde3d5f43ef1ac73e13ff235d.poster.avif?t=1746096163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547860/extras/a2e804ddde3d5f43ef1ac73e13ff235d.webm?t=1746096163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547860/extras/a2e804ddde3d5f43ef1ac73e13ff235d.mp4?t=1746096163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong> Interaction </strong><br>\u2022 It is possible to interact with many objects.<br>\u2022 Nonlinearity.<br><br><strong> Opponents </strong><br>\u2022 Various enemies, confront the enemies, explore dark rooms - all this will stand in the way to the salvation of the character.<br>\u2022 Unique epic bosses.<br>\u2022 A large number of weapons.<br>\u2022 Crafting of bullets.<br>\u2022 3 difficulty modes.<br>\u2022 Body Deformation system. (Gore)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547860/extras/b3de516be631a4fdc4f842c94d87c0d1.poster.avif?t=1746096163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547860/extras/b3de516be631a4fdc4f842c94d87c0d1.webm?t=1746096163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547860/extras/b3de516be631a4fdc4f842c94d87c0d1.mp4?t=1746096163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong> Unknown danger, undiscovered world </strong><br>\u2022  The game will give you unrivaled surge of adrenaline, an exciting storyline and unimaginable horrors. The world around the player will change; danger lurks at every turn.<br><br><strong> The revival of the genre </strong><br>\u2022 Three game endings.<br>\u2022 A well-designed environment and properly selected lighting create an atmosphere of horror, high-quality audio sounds \u2013 all this creates a unique world of the game, which keeps you at the peak of tension from the beginning till the end.<br><br>It is recommended to play in headphones, for full immersion.<br><br><strong><u>All characters, events, music and locations are completely fictional, any coincidences with real people, other works, films and games are random.</u></strong>",
